nodata.title=The game's files are not here yet
nodata.1=Diablo II plays with your own copy of the game: the MPQ files
nodata.2=of Diablo II and Lord of Destruction, patch 1.14d. Diablo II
nodata.3=looks for them in /games/diablo2 and on the USB sticks plugged in
nodata.4=(at the top of the stick or in a folder of it).
nodata.5=To play from a USB stick (exFAT or FAT32):
nodata.6=1. Copy the game files onto the stick, in a folder if you like.
nodata.7=2. Plug it in: PeOS opens it by itself (in Curiosity: /media1).
nodata.8=3. Open Diablo II again.
nodata.9=The files: d2data, d2exp, d2char, d2sfx, d2speech, d2music,
nodata.10=d2xmusic, d2xtalk, d2video, d2xvideo and patch_d2 (.mpq).
