# PeStore
store.summary=Diablo II and Lord of Destruction, with your own copy of the game.
store.description=d2decomped, a reimplementation of Diablo II and Lord of Destruction (1.14d), on PeOS. It plays with your own game files: put them on a USB stick and plug it in: Diablo II finds them by itself (or the data disk made with the tool at github.com/teddi201252/peos-d2d, mounted on /games/diablo2).\nThe source of this app is there too (GPL-3.0). Not affiliated with Blizzard Entertainment.
